  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Thickly slice zucchini into half-moons. Place zucchini and peeled & chopped pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle over garlic & herb seasoning and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• Place gnocchi in a baking dish. Drizzle with a generous drizzle of olive oil. Season, toss to coat and spread out evenly. Bake until golden, 15-18 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84514cade9b9f0ace0676/step-8417a900.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the veggies and gnocchi are baking, finely chop garlic.\n• Roughly chop parsley.\n• In a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of olive oil and vinegar. Season to taste, then top with spinach & rocket mix.\n• TIP: Toss the salad just before serving to keep the leaves crisp!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84514cade9b9f0ace0676/step-44982910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Remove gnocchi from oven, then add garlic and thickened cream, stirring to combine.\n• Return to oven and cook until slightly thickened, 4-6 minutes.\n• Gently stir roasted veggies and half the Parmesan cheese through the gnocchi. Season to taste.\n• TIP: Add a splash of water if the gnocchi is looking dry!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84514cade9b9f0ace0676/step-5fc08b20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Toss the salad, then top with flaked almonds.\n• Divide baked pumpkin and Parmesan gnocchi between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with parsley and remaining Parmesan.\n• Serve with spinach, rocket and almond salad. Enjoy",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84514cade9b9f0ace0676/step-1c10c930.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
